invariant: INV-11
file: transcript.h
catches: hkdf384_test
reason: transcript_update_selected feeds SHA-256 as well as SHA-384 in a
  SHA-384 session, so a server hashes every message after its ServerHello
  twice, as it did before docs/decisions.md 146. Every digest a session
  reads is the same, so no handshake fails. test/hkdf384_test.c requires
  the SHA-256 state unchanged after an update at SHA384_LEN.

--- old
    if (hash_len == SHA384_LEN) {
        sha512_update(&t->sha384_state, in, n);
        return;
    }
--- new
    if (hash_len == SHA384_LEN) {
        sha512_update(&t->sha384_state, in, n);
        sha256_update(&t->sha256_state, in, n);
        return;
    }
